LOCATION:The Reading Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: 
 Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/189549\n\nJo
 in us for an inspiring evening of live music featuring student musicians f
 rom the Josiah Quincy Orchestra Program and teaching artists from Boston M
 usic Project\, a nonprofit partner of The ’Quin Impact Fund. Through an 
 intimate performance in The Reading Room\, members will experience the tra
 nsformative power of music and the impact of equitable arts education firs
 thand. This special event celebrates the talent of Boston’s young artist
 s and The ’Quin Impact Fund’s commitment to supporting organizations t
 hat create lasting opportunities through education\, creativity\, and comm
 unity engagement.\n\n*Reservations are not required.
