LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist On
 ly\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/188596\n\nTurn insp
 iration into action at the The 'Quin Impact Fund's Board and Volunteer Fai
 r\, an interactive networking experience connecting attendees directly wit
 h nonprofit organizations shaping the future of our communities.\n\nFeatur
 ing ten mission-driven organizations actively seeking board and committee 
 members\, the fair offers a unique opportunity to engage with nonprofit le
 aders\, explore causes aligned with your passions\, and discover meaningfu
 l pathways to impact. Designed as a dynamic drop-in experience\, guests ar
 e invited to move freely throughout the space\, fostering organic conversa
 tions and new connections. Nonprofits that will be in attendance include\n
 \nBoston Music Project\nBoston Public Art Triennial\nCircle of Hope\nDress
  for Success Boston\nEllis Early Learning\nFamilyAid\nInnerCity Weightlift
 ing\nInstitute for Nonprofit Practice\nProject 351\nThe Children’s Room\
 n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only.
