BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-183090@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260704T150000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260707
SUMMARY:'Venture: Wimbledon
LOCATION:Offsite
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Venture - Travel\nPrice: $12850.47 per person\nSta
 tus: Waitlist Only\nTime: 3 PM – 12 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequ
 inhouse.com/events/183090\n\nAn Exclusive Seat at Tennis' Most Iconic Stag
 e. Experience the Prestige of Wimbledon.\nMore than a visit to London\, th
 is is an invitation to one of sport’s most rarefied worlds - Wimbledon..
 . where tradition\, precision\, and quiet luxury converge on perfectly kep
 t grass courts.\n\nYour weekend centers on Sunday at the All England Lawn 
 Tennis Club\, where members will take their place on Centre Court with cov
 eted Debenture tickets\, among the most exclusive seats in global sport. A
 s the Championships enter the fourth round\, the atmosphere sharpens: the 
 field narrows\, the stakes heighten\, and the game reveals its most compel
 ling drama. From this vantage point\, members will witness the world’s f
 inest players in matches that will define the trajectory to the finals.\n\
 nBetween play\, move at your own pace through the grounds - where champagn
 e is poured with ease\, strawberries and cream remain a ritual\, and every
  detail reflects Wimbledon’s singular blend of heritage and refinement. 
 This is not simply spectating\; it is participation in a cultural institut
 ion\, experienced as it was intended.\n\nCurated with intention\, this is 
 an insider experience of Wimbledon at its most electric\, shared in the co
 mpany of those who appreciate it most.\n\nDay One | Saturday\, July 4th\n\
 nYour journey begins with your arrival in London\, where you will be welco
 med to The Kensington Hotel\, a refined townhouse known for its polished d
 iscretion and residential charm.\n\nOnce checked in\, take a moment to unw
 ind from your travels - whether relaxing in the hotel’s inviting drawing
  rooms or stepping out to explore the surrounding neighborhood at your lei
 sure. The afternoon is yours to ease into the rhythm of the city or connec
 t with fellow ‘Quin members as the experience unofficially begins.\n\nIn
  the evening\, gather for a 'Quin Member welcome dinner hosted by former-L
 ondoner - our very own Managing Director\, Matthias Kiehm at The Audley Pu
 blic House. The Audley is a proper neighborhood Pub where history and cont
 emporary art collide. Here\, amid thoughtfully restored interiors and a co
 nvivial atmosphere\, members will be reintroduced to fellow fans of the sp
 ort over a beautifully prepared dinner while anticipating the next days ma
 tches.\n\nDay Two | Sunday\, July 5th\n\nYour second day begins with a sea
 mless departure from The Kensington Hotel as you make your way to Wimbledo
 n\, with travel arrangements thoughtfully coordinated for ease and comfort
 .\n\nUpon arrival at the All England Lawn Tennis Club on "Middle Sunday\,"
  you will have the full day to experience the Gentlemen's and Ladies' Sing
 les Fourth Round at your own pace. With Debenture ticket(s) in hand\, enjo
 y prime seating on Centre Court - where the field narrows and the tourname
 nt’s momentum becomes palpable. Your tickets also provide access to No. 
 1 Court and the outer courts\, allowing you to move fluidly between matche
 s and take in the breadth of play across the grounds.\n\nThroughout the da
 y\, you will have access to the Debenture Holders’ Lounge and its collec
 tion of private bars and dining venues. Whether pausing for a leisurely lu
 nch\, a glass of champagne\, or a moment of respite overlooking the courts
 \, the experience is yours to shape as you wish.\n\nFollowing the conclusi
 on of play\, return to London in the early evening. Keeping dynamic match 
 times in mind\, the day concludes with a relaxed late-evening group dinner
 \, in a stylish yet comfortable setting to unwind and reflect before retur
 ning to The Kensington Hotel for a well-deserved nights rest.\n\nDay Three
  | Monday\, July 6th\n\nYour final morning begins at a relaxed pace with b
 reakfast at The Kensington Hotel. Enjoy a quiet start to the day - whether
  over a leisurely meal or a final moment of calm in the hotel’s inviting
  surroundings.\n\nFollowing breakfast\, departures will take place on your
  own schedule - whether returning home\, or staying on for an independent 
 extension to the trip. As you make your way home\, carry with you the memo
 ries of a weekend defined by exceptional access\, thoughtful curation\, an
 d the shared experience of Wimbledon at its most compelling.\n\nClassic Ro
 om | Single Occupancy\n\nClassic Room at The Kensington Hotel | Two Twin 
 Beds with Breakfast Included\n\nOne Wimbledon Debenture Ticket to the Gen
 tlemen's and Ladies' Singles Fourth Round\, including Centre Court seating
  and the Debenture's Holders' Lounge with its collection of private bars a
 nd dining venues.\n\nTwo curated group dinners\, including a welcome dinne
 r at The Audley Public House.\n\n$7\,950\n\nClassic Room | Double Occupanc
 y\n\nClassic Room at The Kensington Hotel | Queen Bed with Breakfast Inclu
 ded\n\nTwo Wimbledon Debenture Tickets to the Gentlemen's and Ladies' Sing
 les Fourth Round\, including Centre Court seating and the Debenture's Hold
 ers' Lounge with its collection of private bars and dining venues.\n\nTwo 
 curated group dinners\, including a welcome dinner at The Audley Public Ho
 use.\n\n$13\,750\n\nPlease note the price of airfare is not included in th
 e ticket price. Members and their guests are responsible for booking their
  own flights. For the smoothest arrival experience\, we recommend flying i
 nto London Heathrow Airport (LHR) located less than an hour by car from Th
 e Kensington Hotel.\n\n* Reservations are non-refundable and non-transfera
 ble. Please note that all bookings are subject to the terms and conditions
  outlined in the final confirmation materials including your sign-off on a
  standard liability waiver.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/183090
CATEGORIES:‘Venture - Travel
END:VEVENT
